# ==============================================================================
# Production build-time public environment variables
# These NEXT_PUBLIC_* vars are baked into the JS bundle at `next build`.
# This file is intentionally committed — it contains NO secrets.
# Secret/server-side vars (PADDLE_API_KEY, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, etc.)
# must be set on the server via .env.local or the host's environment panel.
# ==============================================================================

# Paddle Billing — public (browser-visible) vars
# Override NEXT_PUBLIC_PADDLE_ENV to 'production' and update the token
# in Hostinger's Node.js environment settings when going live.
